  "prompt": "How many order lines are resent copies? This table may hold errors. Some order lines were sent twice under a new order_line_id. Two lines are copies of one order line when order_id, product_id, quantity, unit_price_eur, promo_id and line_discount_eur all match, with a missing promo_id matching a missing one; every line beyond the first of such a set is a resent copy. Return one column, n_copies. The result is a single row. Any row order is fine.",
